meta {
  name: Create Radiology Test
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/master-data/{{masterDataId}}/radiology-tests
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "testName": "CT Chest Plain",
    "testDisplayName": "CT Chest",
    "testCode": "CT-CHEST-01",
    "aka": "Computed Tomography Thorax",
    "modality": "CT",
    "bodyPart": "Chest",
    "view": "Axial",
    "isContrast": false,
    "departmentId": "b94e2bc2-37e7-41b8-8ad3-5725b99f02c9",
    "categoryId": "fd0c238e-9724-4084-83f8-f83b32e60096",
    "subCategoryId": "b422e711-e269-455d-8c74-aaa1632946a3",
    "icdCode": "R91.8",
    "loincCode": "24627-2",
    "clinicalTags": [
      "thorax",
      "routine"
    ],
    "samplePriorityType": "ROUTINE",
    "isEnableCms": true,
    "approvalWorkflow": "SINGLE_APPROVAL",
    "priceMsrp": 4500,
    "priceMaximum": 4200,
    "priceMinimum": 3000,
    "priceOriginal": 4400,
    "franchisePrice": 3500,
    "emergencyPrice": 5500,
    "commissionPrice": 300,
    "discountCapPct": 15,
    "isAllowPriceOverride": false,
    "isAllowDiscounts": true,
    "tatMinValue": 2,
    "tatMinUnit": "HOURS",
    "tatMaxValue": 24,
    "tatMaxUnit": "HOURS",
    "scheduleDays": [
      "MONDAY",
      "TUESDAY",
      "WEDNESDAY",
      "THURSDAY",
      "FRIDAY"
    ],
    "scheduleFrom": "08:00",
    "scheduleTo": "18:00",
    "isHideInOrderScreen": false,
    "isPreferenceTest": true,
    "isOutsource": false,
    "isBillOnlyTest": false,
    "isActive": true,
    "usefulFor": "Evaluation of lung parenchyma, mediastinum and pleura",
    "interpretationOfResults": "Reported by the radiologist on the images",
    "limitations": "Limited soft-tissue contrast without IV contrast",
    "remarks": "Remove metallic objects before the scan",
    "references": "ACR Appropriateness Criteria",
    "preparationInstructions": "No special preparation required for a plain study"
  }
}

vars:pre-request {
  masterDataId: 2db13b5e-4a25-412f-bcd9-68bcbeea9d59
}

script:post-response {
  const data = res.getBody() && res.getBody().data;
  if (data && data.id) bru.setEnvVar("radiologyTestId", data.id);
}

tests {
  test("201 Created", function () {
    expect(res.getStatus()).to.equal(201);
  });
}

docs {
  🔒 **RBAC:** requires `business_admin:master_data__add_test` — enforced by
  `PermissionGuard` (`@RequirePermission`). A caller whose effective permissions
  (user override ?? branch-role override ?? role baseline) lack this get **403
  `PERMISSION_DENIED`**; the `business_admin` / `administrator` roles bypass all
  checks, so `{{businessAccessToken}}` (an admin) still succeeds here.

  Create a radiology test inside a master data (`tenantId`/`branchId` from the JWT
  + the path's master data). Captures `radiologyTestId`. The radiology model is
  **FLAT** — the parallel of a lab test but with **no nested samples or result
  parameters** (imaging has no specimens/analytes), so the whole payload is a
  single scalar object. A `versionHistory` v1 is seeded on the row.

  This body is the **full field set the Add Radiology Test form (kaltros-fe) can
  send**, so it doubles as the FE↔BE contract reference.

  ## Field groups (form section → payload)

  - **Identity:** `testName` (2–255, **required**), `testDisplayName` (≤255),
    `testCode` (1–50, **required**), `aka` (≤255).
  - **Radiology classification:** `modality` (enum, see below), `bodyPart`
    (≤255), `view` (≤255), `isContrast` (bool).
  - **Classification (logical refs):** `departmentId`, `categoryId`,
    `subCategoryId` — optional UUIDs validated as UUIDs but **not FK-checked**
    here. Replace the placeholders with real ids from `GET /departments` ·
    `/categories` · `/sub-categories`.
  - **Basic config:** `icdCode` (≤50), `loincCode` (≤50), `clinicalTags[]`
    (string[]), `samplePriorityType` (enum), `isEnableCms` (bool),
    `approvalWorkflow` (enum), `reportTemplateId` (optional UUID logical ref).
  - **Pricing (integer minor units, ≥0):** `priceMsrp`, `priceMaximum`,
    `priceMinimum`, `priceOriginal`, `franchisePrice`, `emergencyPrice`,
    `commissionPrice`, `discountCapPct` (0–100), `isAllowPriceOverride`,
    `isAllowDiscounts`.
  - **TAT:** `tatMinValue`/`tatMinUnit`, `tatMaxValue`/`tatMaxUnit`.
  - **Schedule:** `scheduleDays[]` (MONDAY…SUNDAY, unique),
    `scheduleFrom`/`scheduleTo` ("HH:mm", 24h).
  - **Flags:** `isHideInOrderScreen`, `isPreferenceTest`, `isOutsource`,
    `isBillOnlyTest`.
  - **Status:** `isActive` (Active/Inactive).
  - **Notes:** `usefulFor`, `interpretationOfResults`, `limitations`, `remarks`,
    `references`, `preparationInstructions`.

  ## Enums (UPPERCASE)

  `modality` (XRAY|CT|MRI|ULTRASOUND|MAMMOGRAPHY|PET|FLUOROSCOPY|DEXA|OTHER),
  `samplePriorityType` (ROUTINE|URGENT|STAT),
  `approvalWorkflow` (SINGLE_APPROVAL|DUAL_APPROVAL|AUTO_APPROVE|PATHOLOGIST_REVIEW),
  `tat*Unit` (MINUTES|HOURS|DAYS), `scheduleDays` (MONDAY…SUNDAY).

  ## Conflicts & cross-field rules

  - `testName` / `testCode` unique **per master data** among active rows → 409
    `RADIOLOGY_TEST_NAME_CONFLICT` / `RADIOLOGY_TEST_CODE_CONFLICT`.
  - `priceMaximum ≤ priceMsrp`, `priceMinimum ≤ priceMaximum` → 422
    `VALIDATION_ERROR`.
  - 404 `MASTER_DATA_NOT_FOUND` if the parent master data is missing/other tenant.

  > `code` and any list price are system-set — never send them.
}
